---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import SundayReset from '../../components/SundayReset.astro';
---
<Base title="Beauty | Sundays with Anna">

<section class="p" style="padding-top:56px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap"><h1 class="hd" style="margin:0;font-size:150px">Beauty</h1><p style="margin:0 0 14px;max-width:340px;font-size:15px;color:#5C5C5C">Every product reviewed here is one I have used myself. Filter by what your skin feels today.</p></section>
<SundayReset />
<section class="p" style="padding-top:28px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="pill on" href="#" data-f="all">All</a><a class="pill" href="#" data-f="dry">Dry and tight</a><a class="pill" href="#" data-f="pores">Visible pores</a><a class="pill" href="#" data-f="sun">Sun protection</a><a class="pill" href="#" data-f="dark">Dark spots</a></section>
<section id="grid" class="p kg-a" style="padding-top:32px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))">
<a class="kc kc-f" data-t="sun" href="/beauty/round-lab-birch-juice-sunscreen-review/"><div class="kc-top"><span class="kc-kind"><b>01</b>Review</span><span class="kc-pill">Sun protection</span></div><div class="kc-img"><div class="kc-ph"><img src="/img/round-lab-cover.webp" alt="" style="object-position:50% 50%"></div></div><div class="kc-body"><h3 class="hd kc-h">Round Lab Birch Juice sunscreen: all four versions compared</h3><p class="kc-p">Sunscreen, sun serum, Mild-Up and the stick: texture, white cast, under makeup, and which one to buy.</p><ul class="kc-chips"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M9 9h6M9 13h6M9 17h3"/></svg>Product facts</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6l-5 9a2 2 0 0 0 2 3h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-3l-5-9V3"/><path d="M8 15h8"/></svg>Ingredients</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3c3 4 6 7 6 10.5A6 6 0 0 1 6 13.5C6 10 9 7 12 3z"/></svg>Skin concerns</li></ul><div class="kc-foot"><span class="kc-more">Read the review</span><span class="kc-arrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></div></div></a>
<a class="kc" data-t="pores" href="/beauty/medicube-zero-pore-pad-review/"><div class="kc-top"><span class="kc-kind"><b>02</b>Review</span><span class="kc-pill">Visible pores</span></div><div class="kc-img"><div class="kc-ph"><img src="/img/sink.webp" alt="" style="object-position:50% 100%"></div></div><div class="kc-body"><h3 class="hd kc-h">Medicube Zero Pore Pad 2.0, three years in</h3><p class="kc-p">How I use it, what it did for blackheads and pores, and how it compares with Celimax.</p><ul class="kc-chips"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M9 9h6M9 13h6M9 17h3"/></svg>Product facts</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6l-5 9a2 2 0 0 0 2 3h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-3l-5-9V3"/><path d="M8 15h8"/></svg>Ingredients</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3c3 4 6 7 6 10.5A6 6 0 0 1 6 13.5C6 10 9 7 12 3z"/></svg>Skin concerns</li></ul><div class="kc-foot"><span class="kc-more">Read the review</span><span class="kc-arrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></div></div></a>
<a class="kc" data-t="dry" href="/beauty/morning-skincare-routine-dry-skin-winter/"><div class="kc-top"><span class="kc-kind"><b>03</b>Routine</span><span class="kc-pill">Dry and tight</span></div><div class="kc-img"><div class="kc-ph"><img src="/img/bshelf.webp" alt="" style="object-position:50% 50%"></div></div><div class="kc-body"><h3 class="hd kc-h">My morning routine for dry skin in winter</h3><p class="kc-p">What I used at Badeschloss in Bad Gastein: face products, eye patches and SPF.</p><ul class="kc-chips"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.5 14.5c1 1.2 2.2 1.8 3.5 1.8s2.5-.6 3.5-1.8M9 10h.01M15 10h.01"/></svg>Face products</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12s4-6 10-6 10 6 10 6-4 6-10 6S2 12 2 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5"/></svg>Eye patches</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 3v2M12 19v2M3 12h2M19 12h2M5.6 5.6 7 7M17 17l1.4 1.4M5.6 18.4 7 17M17 7l1.4-1.4"/></svg>SPF</li></ul><div class="kc-foot"><span class="kc-more">Read the review</span><span class="kc-arrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></div></div></a>
<a class="kc" data-t="sun" href="/beauty/round-lab-camellia-deep-collagen-sun-serum-review/"><div class="kc-top"><span class="kc-kind"><b>04</b>Review</span><span class="kc-pill">Sun protection</span></div><div class="kc-img"><div class="kc-ph"><span>Photo coming soon</span></div></div><div class="kc-body"><h3 class="hd kc-h">Round Lab Camellia Deep Collagen sun serum</h3><p class="kc-p">SPF 50+ with collagen and retinoid: what they really do, the texture and how to use it.</p><ul class="kc-chips"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M9 9h6M9 13h6M9 17h3"/></svg>Product facts</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6l-5 9a2 2 0 0 0 2 3h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-3l-5-9V3"/><path d="M8 15h8"/></svg>Ingredients</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3c3 4 6 7 6 10.5A6 6 0 0 1 6 13.5C6 10 9 7 12 3z"/></svg>Skin concerns</li></ul><div class="kc-foot"><span class="kc-more">Read the review</span><span class="kc-arrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></div></div></a>
<a class="kc" data-t="sun" href="/beauty/beauty-of-joseon-relief-sun-review/"><div class="kc-top"><span class="kc-kind"><b>05</b>Review</span><span class="kc-pill">Sun protection</span></div><div class="kc-img"><div class="kc-ph"><span>Photo coming soon</span></div></div><div class="kc-body"><h3 class="hd kc-h">Beauty of Joseon Relief Sun: Rice + Probiotics vs Aqua-Fresh</h3><p class="kc-p">UV filters, SPF lab results, white cast and who it suits.</p><ul class="kc-chips"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M9 9h6M9 13h6M9 17h3"/></svg>Product facts</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6l-5 9a2 2 0 0 0 2 3h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-3l-5-9V3"/><path d="M8 15h8"/></svg>Ingredients</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3c3 4 6 7 6 10.5A6 6 0 0 1 6 13.5C6 10 9 7 12 3z"/></svg>Skin concerns</li></ul><div class="kc-foot"><span class="kc-more">Read the review</span><span class="kc-arrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></div></div></a>
<a class="kc" data-t="dry" href="/beauty/biodance-bio-collagen-real-deep-mask-review/"><div class="kc-top"><span class="kc-kind"><b>06</b>Review</span><span class="kc-pill">Dry and tight</span></div><div class="kc-img"><div class="kc-ph"><span>Photo coming soon</span></div></div><div class="kc-body"><h3 class="hd kc-h">Biodance Bio-Collagen mask: pink, blue and purple compared</h3><p class="kc-p">How long to wear it, what it can and cannot do, and the blue and purple versions.</p><ul class="kc-chips"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M9 9h6M9 13h6M9 17h3"/></svg>Product facts</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6l-5 9a2 2 0 0 0 2 3h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-3l-5-9V3"/><path d="M8 15h8"/></svg>Ingredients</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3c3 4 6 7 6 10.5A6 6 0 0 1 6 13.5C6 10 9 7 12 3z"/></svg>Skin concerns</li></ul><div class="kc-foot"><span class="kc-more">Read the review</span><span class="kc-arrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></div></div></a>
<a class="kc" data-t="dark" href="/beauty/axis-y-dark-spot-correcting-glow-serum-review/"><div class="kc-top"><span class="kc-kind"><b>07</b>Review</span><span class="kc-pill">Dark spots</span></div><div class="kc-img"><div class="kc-ph"><span>Photo coming soon</span></div></div><div class="kc-body"><h3 class="hd kc-h">Axis-Y Dark Spot Glow Serum</h3><p class="kc-p">What 5% niacinamide can and cannot do, what TikTok and Reddit say, and how to use it.</p><ul class="kc-chips"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M9 9h6M9 13h6M9 17h3"/></svg>Product facts</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6l-5 9a2 2 0 0 0 2 3h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-3l-5-9V3"/><path d="M8 15h8"/></svg>Ingredients</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3c3 4 6 7 6 10.5A6 6 0 0 1 6 13.5C6 10 9 7 12 3z"/></svg>Skin concerns</li></ul><div class="kc-foot"><span class="kc-more">Read the review</span><span class="kc-arrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></div></div></a>
<div class="kc kc-soon" aria-hidden="true"><div class="hand">more reviews coming soon</div><p>New notes land here every week.</p></div>
</section>


<script is:inline>
document.querySelectorAll('.pill[data-f]').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(e){e.preventDefault();document.querySelectorAll('.pill[data-f]').forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove('on')});b.classList.add('on');var f=b.dataset.f;document.querySelectorAll('#grid>a').forEach(function(c){c.style.display=(f==='all'||c.dataset.t===f)?'':'none'})})});
</script>
<style is:global>
.s #grid.kg-a{gap:0;border-top:1px solid #C9C9C9;border-left:1px solid #C9C9C9}
.s .kc{display:flex;flex-direction:column;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;background:#fff;padding:22px 22px 24px;border-right:1px solid #C9C9C9;border-bottom:1px solid #C9C9C9;transition:background .35s}
.s a.kc:hover{background:#F7F7F7}
.s .kc-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px}
.s .kc-kind{font-family:'Inter Tight',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#8A8A8A;letter-spacing:.04em}
.s .kc-kind b{color:#B0475E;font-weight:700;margin-right:10px;letter-spacing:.08em}
.s .kc-pill{border:1px solid #8A8A8A;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;font-family:'Inter Tight',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4A4A4A;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .3s,border-color .3s,color .3s}
.s a.kc:hover .kc-pill{background:#F2C6D3;border-color:#F2C6D3;color:#8F2E47}
.s .kc-img{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1;overflow:hidden;background:#E9E6E1}
.s .kc-ph{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#8A8A8A;font-family:'Inter Tight',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
.s .kc-ph img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;max-height:none;transition:transform 1.1s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.s a.kc:hover .kc-ph img{transform:scale(1.05)}
.s .kc-body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;padding-top:22px}
.s .kc-h{margin:0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.02;color:#3A3A3A;text-wrap:balance;transition:color .3s}
.s a.kc:hover .kc-h{color:#B0475E}
.s .kc-p{margin:14px 0 0;font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A4A4A}
.s .kc-chips{list-style:none;margin:16px 0 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 14px}
.s .kc-chips li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:'Inter Tight',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#6A6A6A}
.s .kc-chips svg{color:#B0475E;flex:none}
.s .kc-foot{margin-top:auto;padding-top:22px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.s .kc-foot::before{content:none}
.s .kc-body .kc-foot{border-top:1px solid #DADADA;margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px}
.s .kc-more{font-family:'Inter Tight',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B0475E}
.s .kc-arrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #B0475E;color:#B0475E;transition:background .3s,color .3s,transform .3s}
.s a.kc:hover .kc-arrow{background:#B0475E;color:#fff;transform:translateX(4px)}
.s .kc-f{grid-column:span 2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-areas:"top top" "img body";grid-template-rows:auto 1fr;column-gap:28px}
.s .kc-f .kc-top{grid-area:top}
.s .kc-f .kc-img{grid-area:img;aspect-ratio:auto;min-height:420px}
.s .kc-f .kc-body{grid-area:body;padding-top:0;justify-content:center}
.s .kc-f .kc-h{font-size:42px}
.s .kc-f .kc-p{font-size:19px}
.s .kc-f .kc-foot{margin-top:28px}
.s .kc-soon{background:#F2C6D3;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;gap:10px;min-height:300px}
.s .kc-soon .hand{font-size:42px;line-height:1;color:#8F2E47}
.s .kc-soon p{margin:0;font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-size:16px;color:#8F2E47}
@media (min-width:1500px){.s #grid.kg-a{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)) !important}.s .kg-a .kc-h{font-size:24px}.s .kg-a .kc-f .kc-h{font-size:36px}.s .kg-a .kc-p{font-size:16px}.s .kg-a .kc-f .kc-p{font-size:18px}.s .kg-a .kc-f .kc-img{min-height:380px}.s .kg-a .kc-soon{grid-column:1/-1;min-height:150px}}
@media (max-width:900px){.s #grid{grid-template-columns:1fr !important}.s .kc-f{grid-column:auto;display:flex}.s .kc-f .kc-img{aspect-ratio:1/1;min-height:0}.s .kc-f .kc-body{padding-top:22px}.s .kc-f .kc-h{font-size:30px}}
</style>
</Base>
